    "detailed_description": "<strong>From a long time ago, there was a tale of a mystical cave full of treasures. Many brave souls went for the quest to find it, but none of them return.<br>Three friends decide to try the luck to find the cave. But they do not know that a road to cave is full of deadly traps and fearful guardians.<br>Help young adventurers to find the cave, solve all puzzles, defeat cave guardians, steal cave treasures and get back home safely.<br>Good luck on your journey!<br><br>Features:<br>* Logical puzzles <br>* Turn-based JRPG styled combat.<br>* Three heroes.<br>* Quick and slick save\\load system.<br>* Pixel graphics.<br>* Atmospheric OST.<br>* Achievements.<br>* Keyboard and mouse control.</strong>",
